7\u0644\u0645\u0648\u0642\u0639 \u0644\u0644\u0648\u0635\u0648\u0644 \u0625\u0644\u0649 \u0627\u0644\u0623\u062f\u0644\u0629 \u0648\u0641\u0643 \u0631\u0645\u0648\u0632 \u0627\u0644\u0623\u0644\u063a\u0627\u0632 \u0627\u0644\u0645\u0631\u062a\u0628\u0637\u0629 \u0628\u0647\u0630\u0627 \u0627\u0644\u0645\u0643\u0627\u0646.\r\n\r\n[DEVELOPER]\r\n\r\nThis game was fully designed and developed by a single solo independent developer, dedicated to bringing a unique and engaging indie gaming experience to the community.\r\n\r\n[CASE]\r\n\r\nCASE is an investigative puzzle adventure game focused on exploration and solving mysteries within a dark, atmospheric environment. Players step into the shoes of a detective working to uncover hidden truths and solve crime scenes across standalone, independent cases.\r\n\r\n[ STORY CHAPTERS ]\r\n\r\nIn Chapter 1, the detective begins their mission by traveling to Khalid's house, conducting a thorough search of the area and tackling environmental puzzles to retrieve the missing Case file and secure critical documents.\r\n\r\nChapter 2 marks a complete transition into a brand new case entirely separate from previous events. Taking place inside a local grocery store, the detective must launch a fresh investigation and explore the venue to crack the codes and puzzles tied to this location.\r\n\r\n"
